# ── Reference media — ~410MB of inputs, not library content ───────────
# The KT videos and extracted audio. Keep them LOCALLY: _meta/visual-kt-delta.md
# records why they must not be deleted — two of the library's conclusions were
# corrected by looking at frames, not transcripts. Too big for git; use Git LFS
# or shared storage if collaborators ever need them.
assets/videos/
assets/audio/

# Contact sheets: 9MB of derived PNGs, regenerable with the ffmpeg one-liner in
# _meta/source-media.md. Delete this line if you'd rather version the evidence.
assets/frames/

# ── HyperFrames install — upstream, scaffolded, not ours ──────────────
# Runs entirely through npx (no node_modules), so it re-scaffolds cleanly from
# its own SETUP.md. Not worth versioning 5.8MB of upstream skill content.
hyperframes/

# ── Per-video output ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Design documents and build manifests for individual videos — ephemeral.
# NOTE: _profiles/ is deliberately NOT ignored. A style profile is reusable
# library content and belongs in the repo.
_projects/

# ── Junk ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
Thumbs.db
node_modules/
*.tar.gz
